      "writtenOn": "2026-08-13T08:07:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "T22 platforms do not use the 1kW paddle board, so these two configs will never be probed on T22. This change is therefore a no-op for T22.\n\nThe reason the scale factors are needed is that T2 and T22 share a unified device tree:\nthe TPS25990 nodes at 0x47/0x4b were removed from the shared DTS to resolve address conflicts with T22, so the Rimon value can no longer be passed to the driver on T2. This EM config change compensates for that on T2 only.",
      "parentUuid": "e5d7ae35_33d2a543",
